Once again I was playing around in wizard (-u wizard -D) mode.  This time
I was reading cursed scrolls of create monsters, creating ones whose
corpses bequeath intrinsics on the happy character.  (A blessed tinning
kit helps in these endeavors.  After the mayhem is over you can sit down
to a dinner of blessed tins of black pudding meat.) 

After eating a stalker corpse I hit Ctrl-x to see what my intrinsics were.
Hallucination resistance was one of them.  I have never seen this intrinsic
before and I have not been able to reduplicate it.  I'm not even sure I
got it from eating the stalker.

So, has anybody else seen this intrinsic before?  What does one have to 
eat to get it?  Not that hallucination resistance is very useful as far as
intrinsics go, but it would keep me from clobbering my pets.

